    "Finite queue cannot preserve arbitrarily many distinct unserviced reports. Six-slot candidate passes four sensor types plus any two background types, but loses voltage if all seven distinct types are unserviced simultaneously.",
    "No firmware/SDK production source changed by these isolated tests. Actual source-aware linked acceptance is required before release."
